# --- Python -----------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Virtual environments ---------------------------------------------
# Windows venvs are not relocatable and are ~300MB. Never commit one.
.venv/
venv/
venv_*/
env/
ENV/

# --- Data cache -------------------------------------------------------
# nflverse pulls are reproducible from the loaders in data/nflverse.py, so
# the cache is derived data, not source. A full pbp history is ~1GB.
cache/*.parquet
cache/*.csv
!cache/.gitkeep

# EXCEPT THE EVIDENCE, WHICH HAPPENS TO LIVE IN cache/ TOO.
#
# These three are not derived and cannot be rebuilt: captured odds are a
# snapshot of a price at a moment, and a re-pull days later returns a
# different number or nothing at all. The blanket `cache/*.parquet` above
# swept them up by WHERE THEY LIVE rather than WHAT THEY ARE, and the
# consequence only showed up on Streamlit Community Cloud -- which serves
# the GitHub repo, not the local folder. Slates are tracked, so the app
# loaded a week and its games correctly and then reported "no posted lines,
# run run_slate.py" with the lines sitting un-pushed on disk.
#
# Small and append-only: ~30KB per week of edges, 75KB of scoring log.
!cache/market_log.parquet
!cache/edges_*.parquet
!cache/scoring_log.parquet

# --- Predictions and scoring logs -------------------------------------
# These ARE the evidence and they are append-only, so they are tracked
# deliberately -- with one exception below. If a weekly slate file ever
# gets large enough to be annoying, compress it; do not stop tracking it.
# (baseball's scoring_log.csv is the reason the model can be argued about
# at all.)
slates/*.tmp
*.parquet.tmp

# --- Secrets ----------------------------------------------------------
# .env holds the Odds API key. .env.example is the committed template.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets.json
odds_api_key.txt

# --- OS / editor ------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# --- Secrets (second location) ----------------------------------------
.odds_api_key

# --- OneDrive ---------------------------------------------------------
# This repo lives under OneDrive. These are its sync artifacts.
*.tmp
~$*
